WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.500
Lesson 01. Introduction.

2
00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:15.500
Educational content only. Not financial advice. Trading involves risk; you can lose money.

3
00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:43.665
90 days between 24,930 and 30,331.

4
00:00:43.665 --> 00:00:51.673
Name the range, the levels, and the stop on this 2023 window.

5
00:00:51.673 --> 00:00:56.673
Point to a day whose close is still inside the band.

6
00:00:56.673 --> 00:01:02.802
Write the stop as the day the path leaves 30331 and does not return.

7
00:01:02.802 --> 00:01:10.336
Analogy: rungs wait. The chart is the real path.

8
00:01:10.336 --> 00:01:37.543
Use the real low and the real high.

9
00:01:37.543 --> 00:02:16.640
Six gaps of about 900. One rung was crossed 10 times.

10
00:02:16.640 --> 00:02:30.765
Analogy: two rails. Chart: 24,930 and 30,331.

11
00:02:30.765 --> 00:02:41.731
The whole window stays on screen.

12
00:02:41.731 --> 00:03:03.440
19 July 2023. Close 29,914.

13
00:03:03.440 --> 00:03:25.152
8 August 2023. Close 29,765.

14
00:03:25.152 --> 00:03:47.312
24 August 2023. Close 26,162.

15
00:03:47.312 --> 00:04:09.495
13 September 2023. Close 26,228.

16
00:04:09.495 --> 00:04:31.676
29 September 2023. Close 26,912.

17
00:04:31.676 --> 00:04:53.636
16 October 2023. Close 28,519.

18
00:04:53.636 --> 00:05:28.109
23 October 2023. The close leaves 30,331.

19
00:05:28.109 --> 00:05:43.152
Example only. Low, high, six gaps, one stop.

20
00:05:43.152 --> 00:05:53.000
The range was the real low and the real high, 24930 and 30331.

21
00:05:53.000 --> 00:05:58.047
The levels were six gaps of about 900, and one rung was crossed ten times.

22
00:05:58.047 --> 00:06:04.029
The stop was the October leave, when 30331 stayed behind the path.

